# Upstream envconfig/config.go at v0.40.3: disables remote inference and web
# search. The server binary has no updater or telemetry environment knob; the
# desktop app updater is not built or shipped in these archives.
OLLAMA_NO_CLOUD=1
# Avoid persisting interactive readline history if this binary is also used as
# a client. This is an upstream envconfig knob, not a substitute for NO_CLOUD.
OLLAMA_NOHISTORY=1
